{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"やったな、甘奈……！","trans":"做到了啊，甘奈……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6014003050010","name":"甘奈","text":"──……やった……？","trans":"──……做到了……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6014003050020","name":"甘奈","text":"……そっか……！\r\nうん……甘奈……やった──……！！","trans":"……这样啊……！\n嗯……我……做到了──……！！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6014003050030","name":"甘奈","text":"甘奈、やったよ……！\r\nプロデューサーさん……！","trans":"我做到了……！\n制作人……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"確かに見てた\r\nおめでとう……！","trans":"我确实看到了\n恭喜……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6014003050050","name":"甘奈","text":"……うん。甘奈、大丈夫\r\nこのまま、頑張れる──","trans":"……嗯。我没问题\n就这样，继续努力──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6014003050060","name":"甘奈","text":"──絶対、決勝でも頑張ってみせるから","trans":"──决赛我也一定会好好努力","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6014003050070","name":"甘奈","text":"ついてきて……！\r\nね……！？","trans":"陪着我……！\n好吗……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}